// expect-error: NITPICK-RESOLVE-004
//
// `mod:twoways;` searches for `twoways.npk` OR `twoways/mod.npk`
// (MODULE_REFERENCE 1.1), and BOTH exist. Two files can supply one module, and
// picking one silently makes the answer depend on something the reader cannot
// see -- the same rule as a path supplied by two dependency roots.
mod:mod_ambiguous;
mod:twoways;
